### TrabajaYA API - IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client
# Captura los tokens de login y pega aqui los valores locales. No compartas este archivo con tokens reales.
@base = http://localhost:8080/api
@clientToken = PEGA_TOKEN_CLIENTE
@workerToken = PEGA_TOKEN_TRABAJADOR
@jobId = 1
@assignmentId = 1

### Salud publica
GET {{base}}/health

### Login cliente demo
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"cliente@trabajaya.demo","password":"Demo2026!"}

### Login trabajador demo
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"trabajador@trabajaya.demo","password":"Demo2026!"}

### Mi perfil
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### Publicar - ajusta fecha e ids de categoria
POST {{base}}/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Instalar una lampara","description":"Instalar una lampara con materiales disponibles y herramienta propia del trabajador.","categoryId":1,"city":"Pasto","zone":"Centro","address":"Direccion privada de demostracion","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"scheduledAt":"2030-05-20T09:00:00-05:00","durationHours":2,"workersNeeded":1,"initialPrice":60000,"maxPrice":100000,"incrementAmount":10000,"intervalMinutes":10,"autoIncrease":false,"mediaIds":[]}

### Mis publicaciones
GET {{base}}/jobs?mine=true
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### Aumentar oferta
POST {{base}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/increase
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount":10000}

### Detalle como trabajador: sin direccion antes de aceptar
GET {{base}}/jobs/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{workerToken}}

### Aceptar precio actual (cambia expectedPrice si corresponde)
POST {{base}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{workerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedPrice":70000}

### Enviar mensaje
POST {{base}}/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{workerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"body":"Hola, llevare las herramientas.","mediaId":null}

### Avanzar uno por uno: EN_CAMINO, EN_LUGAR, INICIADO, TERMINADO
POST {{base}}/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{workerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"EN_CAMINO"}

### Confirmar como cliente, solo despues de TERMINADO
POST {{base}}/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"CONFIRMADO"}

### Calificar
POST {{base}}/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"score":5,"comment":"Buen trabajo y comunicacion."}
